<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Soufflet Paris barley tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Soufflet Paris barley tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's Grain Commission on Friday accepted Soufflet Paris's tender for 25,000 tonnes of barley at $146.89 per tonne, a statement said.</p>
<p>Prices include C and F and shipment is scheduled for January, the statement added.</p>
</text>
